  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: plexus-utils 4.0.1.rhlw-00001",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released org.codehaus.plexus:plexus-utils 4.0.1.rhlw-00001 with a backported security fix.\n\nCVE-2025-67030: Directory Traversal vulnerability in the extractFile method of org.codehaus.plexus.util.Expand in plexus-utils before 6d780b3378829318ba5c2d29547e0012d5b29642. This allows an attacker to execute arbitrary code\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for org.codehaus.plexus:plexus-utils 4.0.1 from Maven Central.",
